<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CVS raised to strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CVS raised to strong buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it raised the rating on CVS Corp to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- shares gained three to 47.</p>
<p>-- earlier on Friday CVS said it would acquire Revco D.S. Inc for $2.8 billion in stock. Revco shares gained 2-3/4 to 40-3/4.</p>
</text>
